            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.99

- Music Sources lists Amazon Music once again, as "Amazon Music (Safari / Chrome)". There is no Apple Silicon build of Amazon's desktop app, so the website is the only way to reach it and a separate entry for the app was misleading. Your existing choice carries over.
]]></description>
